@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L0：message-component 生命周期总览（二期可靠发送版）

actor "业务发布方" as ProducerApp
participant "MessageTemplate\n(core)" as Template
participant "MessageEnvelopeEnricher\n(core.enrich)" as Enricher
participant "MessageIdGenerator\n(core.id)" as IdGen
participant "Foundation ID\n(foundation-component)" as FoundationId
participant "DestinationResolver\n(core.routing)" as Resolver
participant "MessageWireCodec\n(core.codec)" as Codec
participant "MessageSendExecutor\n(core.send)" as SendExecutor
participant "DefaultReliableMessageSender\n(core.send.reliability)" as ReliableSender
participant "RetryExecutor\n(retry-component)" as Retry
participant "MessageProvider\nKafka / Pulsar / RocketMQ4" as Provider
queue "Broker" as Broker
participant "Provider Consumer" as Consumer
participant "MessageContextAccessor\n(core.context)" as Context
participant "MessageHandler" as Handler

== 同步 / 异步发送 ==
ProducerApp -> Template: send(destination, envelope)
Template -> Enricher: enrich(envelope)
Enricher -> IdGen: nextId()
IdGen -> FoundationId: nextId()
FoundationId --> IdGen: global id
IdGen --> Enricher: messageId
Enricher --> Template: enriched envelope
Template -> Resolver: resolve(logical destination)
Resolver --> Template: provider + physical destination
Template -> Codec: encode(enriched envelope)
Codec --> Template: ProviderSendRequest
Template -> SendExecutor: send(PreparedMessageSend)

alt reliability.send.enabled = true
  SendExecutor -> ReliableSender: send(prepared)
  ReliableSender -> Retry: execute(message-send)
  Retry -> ReliableSender: attempt provider.send()
  ReliableSender -> Provider: send(request)
else reliability.send.enabled = false
  SendExecutor -> Provider: send(request)
end

Provider -> Broker: 原生消息发送
Broker --> Provider: ack / reject / timeout / unknown
Provider --> SendExecutor: ProviderSendResult
SendExecutor --> Template: SendResult(status + reliabilityInfo)
Template --> ProducerApp: SendResult

== 消费闭环 ==
Broker -> Consumer: 投递原生消息
Consumer -> Template: ProviderInboundMessage
Template -> Codec: decode(inbound)
Codec --> Template: MessageEnvelope + ConsumeContext
Template -> Context: open(CurrentMessage)
Template -> Handler: handle(envelope, context)
Handler --> Template: SUCCESS / RETRY
Template -> Context: close()
Template --> Consumer: ConsumeDecision
Consumer --> Broker: commit / ack / retry

note over Template,ReliableSender
二期发送可靠性只解决“单次调用维度”的进程内可靠发送增强：
重试、超时、UNKNOWN 保守处理、结果可解释。
它不等价于 Outbox、分布式事务或服务宕机后的补偿投递。
end note
@enduml
